              "id": "step_azuma_ayami_14",
              "type": "choice",
              "content": "无论如何先去树荫看看吧",
              "group": "The second year"
            },
            {
              "id": "step_azuma_ayami_15",
              "type": "choice",
              "content": "想知道绚水你有什么样的浴衣啊！",
